{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44716","headline":"送王颖悟归左绵 · 灵一","name":"送王颖悟归左绵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客意天南兴已阑，不堪言别向仙官。\n梦摇玉佩随旄节，心到金华忆杏坛。\n荒郊极望归云尽，瘦马空嘶落日残。\n想得故山青霭里，泉声入夜独潺潺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}